---
import { PRACTITIONER_URL } from './config';
---

<section class="tw-move tw-move--reverse tw-move--alt tw-section">
  <div class="tw-move-inner">
    <div class="tw-move-media tw-move-media--tall" data-reveal>
      <img
        class="tw-move-img"
        src="/media/library/svhgpt-07-below-deeper-earlier.webp"
        alt="A seated figure on the earth, roots reaching down to a small fire glowing far below the surface."
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="tw-move-text" data-reveal>
      <p class="tw-eyebrow">Who it’s for</p>
      <h2 class="tw-h2">For anyone ready to meet themselves at a <em>deep level.</em></h2>
      <p class="tw-p">
        Including the earliest things — from before you had words, even from before
        birth — still living in the body and the voice.
      </p>
      <p class="tw-p">
        And, equally, it’s for professionals — therapists, coaches, yoga teachers,
        facilitators, bodyworkers — who want to bring this into their work.
        <a href={PRACTITIONER_URL}>There’s a path for that.</a>
      </p>
      <p class="tw-p">
        <strong>No experience needed. You don’t need a good voice. You need an honest
        one.</strong> Go entirely at your own pace, supported by the live Q&amp;A whenever
        you want company.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
